&lt;li&gt;Deep familiarity with the customer engagement and email service provider landscape; informed perspective on what it takes to compete with and differentiate from best-in-class marketing and CRM tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to own a revenue-generating product line with accountability for business outcomes, not just product delivery&lt;/li&gt;
